OL,3,GNEWSACouncil disposed of 2,300 artworks
OL,4,Aover five years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council in Surrey has disposed of
OL,7,Fmore than 2,000 works of art since
OL,8,F2021.
OL,10,FElmbridge Borough Council said it had
OL,11,Fdisposed of 1,436 items from its
OL,12,Fcollection in 2021-22 and a further 927
OL,13,Fthe following financial year. None have
OL,14,Fbeen disposed of since 2023-24.
OL,16,FA council spokesperson said 25 items
OL,17,Fthat "weren't relevant to Elmbridge"
OL,18,Fwere sold for #319 and the rest were
OL,19,Fpassed on to other organisations.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
