OL,3,GNEWSACouncil disposed of 2,300 artworks
OL,4,Aover five years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We periodically review our collection
OL,7,Fso we can continue to collect and
OL,8,Fpreserve items that tell the story of
OL,9,FElmbridge," they said.
